KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
SAT - SAT Math (Year 2024)

Q1. If f(x) = 3x^2 - 5x + 2, what is the value of f(-2)?
  (A) 12
  (B) 18
  (C) 24
  (D) 28
  Answer: C - f(-2) = 3(-2)^2 - 5(-2) + 2 = 3(4) + 10 + 2 = 24.


